  {
   "id": "ROOMES21:123a3",
   "off": 74659,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「一杯 飲んでくかい？」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Stopping for a drink?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES21:123bf",
   "off": 74687,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「南の医療聖堂では\r  バケモノの軍隊を\r  作っているって\u0010\b  もっぱらの噂だ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"They say the Temple of Medicine down south is building an army of monsters...\u0010\bThat's all anyone's talking about.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES21:1240e",
   "off": 74766,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「地方領主の中には\r  魔導聖堂に従わない方も\r  いらっしゃる」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Some of the provincial lords refuse to bow to the Temple of Sorcery.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
